  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs the maintainer, I want the device and simulator checks owed by the M2 lots that cloud sessions coded and merged on 2026-11-05/06, so that each merge is confirmed or fixed before M2 closes.\n\n### Scope\n\nBuild `56fbc564` (dev-swift, Debug, iOS 27 simulator, unsigned). Each list is the \"Mac check needed\" section of the PR body. Read-only, operator accounts only: no public post, vote, alert or upload. Screenshots of fixture content only.\n\n| ✓ | PR | Lot | Screen | Merge |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [ ] | #458 | LOT-085 BBCode toolbar | Composer, new MP focus | 8b431fb0 |\n| [ ] | #459 | LOT-104 smiley picker | Composer | 61f8130b |\n| [ ] | #466 | LOT-089 new topic composer | Composer, filled form only | 11fe7605 |\n| [ ] | #470 | LOT-102 image upload | Composer, upload off without key | 450beb30 |\n| [ ] | #460 | LOT-106 reader display settings | Reader, Réglages › Sujets | a7c06b44 |\n| [ ] | #457 | LOT-107 image loading | Réglages › Général, reader | aab2d4f4 |\n| [ ] | #463 | LOT-087 message actions menu | Reader | ed9506d6 |\n| [ ] | #465 | LOT-108 video placeholder | Reader | 2f2121be |\n| [ ] | #472 | LOT-109 image viewer | Reader → viewer | 9dcd2ba4 |\n| [ ] | #469 | LOT-111 first-unread landing | Reader | b6a445c2 |\n| [ ] | #486 | LOT-113 search inside a topic | Reader → search | c6d65554 |\n| [ ] | #462 | LOT-136 poll display | Reader → poll, never vote | 7585dfdd |\n| [ ] | #464 | LOT-114 filtered posts | Reader → filter | fad1d706 |\n| [ ] | #487 | LOT-115 forum search | Plus › Recherche | 8e11e359 |\n| [ ] | #488 | LOT-171 MP and group MP lists | Messages, fixture threads | 46e4b71f |\n| [ ] | #489 | LOT-124 favourites options | Favoris, Réglages | 1d9c0054 |\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Every row is pass, fail with an issue or fix, or skipped with the reason.\n- [ ] One report on #368.\n",
